   "data_summary": "The 2025 release of hmba-adult-rhesusmacaque-homba-atlas. This atlas assembles the hmba-adult-rhesusmacaque-mri-template (2025) anatomical template and the hmba-adult-rhesusmacaque-homba-annotation (2025) annotation set. Volumes are defined in the hmba-adult-rhesusmacaque-mri-space (2025) coordinate space. Structures are named according to the hmba-mammalian-homba-terminology (2025) terminology. Volumes are provided at 160 \u00b5m resolution."
